Hi Alison,

to get a matrix of clustered objects you could also simply use cutree on 
the hclust object.
something like:
myclust = hclust(dist(mymatrix))
cutree(myclust, k=2:10)
see ?cutree
And use the method below to determine the desited number of clusters

