Hi Michal,

Michal Blazejczyk wrote:
> Hello everyone,
> 
> Is there an "official" and valid cdf R package for this chip type?

The short answer is no.

The gene and exon chips are currently only supported by the xps package 
(in devel), Affy's expression console software, and I believe, 
aroma.affymetrix, none of which require a BioC cdf package.

Best,

